{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2fddc6a4602a128cf66ca5dedf177fed15e8593e3b509080d2acb08e38e582e2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_a:2_4_014_03_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3057b9db4371a00009eade5d00ffbbd7a95bc83e5b208673471e12b89644ed6",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。\n那张年贺状的样张好像公开了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_a:2_4_014_03_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19be5bfd05f854c9f6bf7d0a2dacbdf37f037891b155f3bfabc60c89eeb5da79",
      "text": "协助拍摄的那家神社，\n也得再去当面道个谢才行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_a:2_4_014_03_09_a:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fc83deacc906fe37af01a0bbe1ddebb2b87c2562679d0011e1120d93ef25799",
      "text": "气氛很融洽呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_a:2_4_014_03_09_a:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6be02b100cda3c5fa3a09ea7bba2830edfd7400aa1e3e6a22a1d293003de3f2",
      "text": "周围的反应\n如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_a:2_4_014_03_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af3bf96769e7f35e68963ebcc7f36bf681c4490463a60bf444f69407cad5ce09",
      "text": "嗯。大家都很好相处，氛围很温馨。\n真想也让他们看看成品的年贺状啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_a:2_4_014_03_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d67827a098c1fbb51120d48ae59842d892de1cc9c81b7da7381b352ffd514c5b",
      "text": "家人也夸我拍了张好照片呢。\n和风的设计在爷爷他们那边也广受好评。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_a:2_4_014_03_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:284eef51e2c12c6779e5a9a8d6fd294b5a95089e8d1654a7fa85d398654b8180",
      "text": "虽说展示自己亲自参与企划的东西，\n多少还是有点害羞就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_a:2_4_014_03_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66fa28ce8d8b9662aab5f86d46c69260d346a59122f7e192ea77735d01d56392",
      "text": "但毕竟是花时间拼尽全力构思出来的。\n终于能听到反响，真让人高兴啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_a:2_4_014_03_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:871db4f31b691c1c1c3700e18b1f4cdd417a72bc20238c261780ed26e309df85",
      "text": "而且我觉得这次的工作，也是个客观审视\n自己给别人留下的印象的好机会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_a:2_4_014_03_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c69deb858e0e794ee2e2b5a7660782b6dbf78a2fa48c9d57698440a307b3f46",
      "text": "刚好是在年底推进筹备的，\n新一年的目标也自然而然浮现出来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_a:2_4_014_03_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cb9d92e0ccfda031c250ad42f5f7a0460e2281363d6c4ae9c4d1d4effb391b1",
      "text": "为了能够达成目标，这一年我也想\n脚踏实地诚恳地去面对工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_a:2_4_014_03_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:125bf06650d2f7e0492a25f9fedd01d645d04ee25afaf9883ebf445dcd2ba8f9",
      "text": "所以今后也拜托你了，\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_a:2_4_014_03_09_a:cmd-000035:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa4ae101f126667c03abbba409a5bb55b9dae21542cb178092174727b4cb51ea",
      "text": "那就下一份工作再见吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
